#: ../td-client.cpp:741
msgid "Encrypt the local database?"
msgstr "Lokale Datenbank verschlüsseln?"

#. TRANSLATOR: Database password dialog, secondary content
#: ../td-client.cpp:743
msgid ""
"The account's local database is encrypted only with the key built into "
"TDLib, which opens it for anyone who has its files. Type the account's "
"password again to encrypt it with that."
msgstr ""
"Die lokale Datenbank des Kontos ist nur mit dem in TDLib eingebauten "
"Schlüssel verschlüsselt, der sie jedem öffnet, der ihre Dateien hat. Gib das "
"Passwort des Kontos erneut ein, um sie damit zu verschlüsseln."

#. TRANSLATOR: Database password dialog, primary content
