msgid "The local database is encrypted"
msgstr "Die lokale Datenbank ist verschlüsselt"

#. TRANSLATOR: Database password dialog, secondary content
#: ../td-client.cpp:748
msgid ""
"Encryption with the password is off in the account's settings. Type the "
"password the database is encrypted with, to go back to the key built into "
"TDLib."
msgstr ""
"Die Verschlüsselung mit dem Passwort ist in den Kontoeinstellungen "
"ausgeschaltet. Gib das Passwort ein, mit dem die Datenbank verschlüsselt "
"ist, um zum in TDLib eingebauten Schlüssel zurückzukehren."

#. TRANSLATOR: Database password dialog, title
#. TRANSLATOR: Warning dialog, title
#. TRANSLATOR: Error dialog, title
#. TRANSLATOR: Information dialog, title
#. TRANSLATOR: Error dialog, title
#. TRANSLATOR: Information dialog, title
#. TRANSLATOR: Error dialog, title
